GATE PATH NOTE: the app module's Gradle path is ':android' (apps/android/settings.gradle.kts maps
':android' -> app/, and its own comment states "every P3/A* prompt gate addresses ':android:'"). The
prompt snippet's ':app:' is a template placeholder for the same single module; ':app' does not exist in
the project, so the triad was run as ':android:assembleDebug / :android:lintDebug / :android:testDebugUnitTest'
per the p3-android README gate contract.

STRINGS NOTE (honesty): the platform string catalog (res/values*/strings.xml) is generated from the web
i18n source by apps/shared/i18n/generators/gen-i18n.ts, but that generated output is ALREADY ~194 keys
behind the web source on this branch (pre-existing drift, unrelated to this page — confirmed via
`gen-i18n.ts --check` = DRIFT before any edit). Regenerating would have produced a large, unrelated diff
across android/apple/windows. The five bare-literal keys this page needs that the catalog lacked
(translation_Daily_Distance, translation_Distance_per_Drive, translation_Monthly_Summary,
translation_No_Entries, translation_Odometer_Over_Time) were therefore added directly to the android
catalog (res/values, res/values-ar, res/values-he — the prompt's allowed string-catalog file), matching
the generator's androidName() slug rule (translation.<key> with non [A-Za-z0-9_] -> '_'). The other 11
required strings already existed in the catalog.

