=== SUMMARY ===
data sources : MileagePageViewModel resolves the active vehicle (SelectedVehicleStore + VehiclesStore =
               web useSelectedVehicle / default-to-first) then combines the shared S8 AnalyticsStore feeds
               mileageStats(id) [spine] + dailyMileage(id,90) + monthlyMileage(id) into one
               StateFlow<UiState<MileageData>> (collectAsStateWithLifecycle). No HTTP in the view.
units        : SI on the wire; converted only at the render boundary via the live UnitFormatter (useUnits)
               + convertDistanceFromSI in MileageProjection (Phase-48 SI-canonical).
a11y/theme   : Modifier.semantics contentDescription on both charts + loading; metric accents from
               MaterialTheme.colorScheme / TeslaTokens.status (dynamic color + dark theme); Material 3 only,
               no webview.
nav          : Destinations 'mileage' -> /mileage (pre-existing) wired to MileageRoute() via
               PageHosts.register; deep link auto-registered by TeslaSyncNavHost.
tests        : MileageProjectionTest (15) — decode of all 3 feeds, km->display (km + mi), 4 metrics,
               null-odometer filtering, daily bars, per-drive monthly rows, empty/no-vehicle gates, date label.
